prompt:
Extract the demurrage, detention, terminal storage and chassis terms that apply to a container at USLAX carried by Maersk.

CONTRACT AND TARIFF TEXT
------------------------
SERVICE CONTRACT SC-2026-0042 - PORT OF LOS ANGELES / LONG BEACH
SECTION 7. FREE TIME AND DEMURRAGE
7.1 Merchant is allowed four (4) calendar days of free time for import
    demurrage, counted from the day after discharge and availability.
7.2 After free time, demurrage accrues per container per day: days 1-3 at
    $200, days 4-6 at $325, day 7 onward at $450.
SECTION 8. DETENTION
8.1 Five (5) calendar days of free time on equipment after gate-out.
8.2 Detention accrues at $150/day for days 1-3, $225/day thereafter.
8.3 Chassis usage is billed at $45/day with no free time.

------------------------

Return free time in days and the full tier table for each charge type present.

Reply with ONE JSON object and nothing else - no prose, no markdown fences. Omit optional fields you cannot fill rather than inventing them, and do not add fields that are not listed. It must validate against this JSON schema:
{
  "$defs": {
    "ChargeType": {
      "enum": [
        "demurrage",
        "detention",
        "storage",
        "chassis"
      ],
      "title": "ChargeType",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "ClockTerms": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Free time plus tier table for a single charge type.",
      "properties": {
        "charge_type": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ChargeType"
        },
        "billed_by": {
          "title": "Billed By",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "free_days": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Free Days",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "tiers": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Tier"
          },
          "title": "Tiers",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "counts_weekends": {
          "default": true,
          "title": "Counts Weekends",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "counts_holidays": {
          "default": true,
          "title": "Counts Holidays",
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "charge_type",
        "billed_by",
        "free_days",
        "tiers"
      ],
      "title": "ClockTerms",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "Tier": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "One band of an escalating rate schedule.\n\n``from_day`` is inclusive and 1-based, counted from the first billed day.\n``to_day`` is inclusive; ``None`` means \"and everything after\".",
      "properties": {
        "from_day": {
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "From Day",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "to_day": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 1,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "To Day"
        },
        "rate_usd": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 0.0,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Rate Usd"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "from_day",
        "rate_usd"
      ],
      "title": "Tier",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "Everything extracted from the service contract and terminal tariff.\n\nThis is the single highest-leverage object in the system: every later\ncalculation depends on it. ``confidence`` is emitted by the extraction\nactivity so low-confidence extractions can be routed to a human on day 1,\nwhen there is no time pressure.",
  "properties": {
    "contract_id": {
      "title": "Contract Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "port": {
      "title": "Port",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "carrier": {
      "title": "Carrier",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "clocks": {
      "additionalProperties": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/ClockTerms"
      },
      "propertyNames": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/ChargeType"
      },
      "title": "Clocks",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "confidence": {
      "default": 1.0,
      "maximum": 1.0,
      "minimum": 0.0,
      "title": "Confidence",
      "type": "number"
    },
    "source_document_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Source Document Id"
    },
    "extraction_notes": {
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Extraction Notes",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "contract_id",
    "port",
    "carrier",
    "clocks"
  ],
  "title": "ContractTerms",
  "type": "object"
}
